'''Nepal''' is the 12th stage in [[Empire of Cats]]. Upon completion in Chapter 1, [[Bird Cat (Normal Cat)|Bird Cat]] and [[Samurai Cat (Special Cat)|Samurai Cat]] will be available to unlock from the [[Upgrade Menu]].

