==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Doge]]s spawn, delay 10.67~18.67 seconds<sup>320f~560f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Snache]]s spawn after 8 seconds<sup>240f</sup>, delay 20~53.33 seconds<sup>600f~1,600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 10~40 seconds<sup>300f~1,200f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**6 [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 2~4 seconds<sup>60f~120f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 98% HP:
**1 [[Pigge]] spawns.
*When the base reaches 78% HP:
**1 [[Pigge]] spawns.

==Strategy==
Start the battle by upgrading the [[Worker Cat]]. When the enemies come near the [[Cat Base]], use [[Tank Cat (Normal Cat)|Tank Cats]] to stall. When Those Guys appear, fire your [[Cat Cannon]]. After some time, you can spawn [[Axe Cat (Normal Cat)|Axe Cat]].

By the time your cats have reached the enemy base, your Worker Cat would have been upgraded to the max level, when that happens spawn [[Cow Cat (Normal Cat)|Cow Cat]]. When Pigge comes to your base, send out [[Gross Cat (Normal Cat)|Gross Cat]] and start spamming meatshields and Axe Cats.

By the time you defeat the Pigge, another one may have spawned. If you don't destroy the enemy base in time, you will need to repeat the same strategy that you used for the first Pigge.

