==Trivia==
*In the [[Nyanko Daisensou|Japanese version]], this stage takes place in '''Yamaguchi Prefecture'''.
*Yamaguchi Prefecture's base is the [[wikipedia:Kintai Bridge|Kintai Bridge]], one of the three most famous bridges in Japan. The pufferfish on top is a reference to the city of [[wikipedia:Shimonoseki|Shimonoseki]], Yamaguchi, which has been dubbed "the pufferfish capital" for supplying more than 80% of Japan's pufferfish.

